OL,3,CFour charged with murder following
OL,4,CLeicester stabbing
OL,6,FFour men have been charged with murder
OL,7,Fafter a 24-year-old man was killed in
OL,8,FLeicester.
OL,10,FArad Niakan was stabbed in De Montfort
OL,11,FPlace off London Road on Wednesday 22
OL,12,FJuly.
OL,14,FHe flagged down a passing police
OL,15,Fofficer near Saxby Street, but later
OL,16,Fdied in hospital.
OL,18,FTen people had been arrested in
OL,19,Fconnection with the incident.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/3
