OL,3,CFour charged with murder following
OL,4,CLeicester stabbing
OL,6,FTalha Satar, 21, and Said Mahamed, 20,
OL,7,Ffrom Spinney Hills, Husni Benramadan,
OL,8,F19, and Yousouf Khan, 18, both of no
OL,9,Ffixed abode, have been charged with
OL,10,Fmurder, said Leicestershire Police.
OL,12,FAll four have also been charged with
OL,13,Fhaving an imitation firearm with
OL,14,Fintent to commit an indictable offence
OL,15,Fand one count of possession of a knife/
OL,16,Fbladed article in a public place.
OL,18,FThey are due to appear at Leicester
OL,19,FMagistrates' Court on Monday, 27 July.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/3
