OL,3,CFour charged with murder following
OL,4,CLeicester stabbing
OL,6,FA fifth man, Kassam Tarmahoomed, 21,
OL,7,Ffrom Stoneygate, has been charged with
OL,8,Fassisting an offender.
OL,10,FA 33-year-old man arrested on
OL,11,Fsuspicion of murder has been released.
OL,13,FTwo men, both 52, and two 43-year-old
OL,14,Fwomen have been released on bail after
OL,15,Fbeing arrested on suspicion of
OL,16,Fassisting an offender.
